@archive 0022
@size 9

script 0 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"…멈추거나 끌 수는\n없을 것 같아."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"부숴 버릴 수밖에 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 1 mmsf3 {
	screenShake
		intensity = 4
		duration = 30
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = NoiseWizardBlue
	"우와아아아!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"매복이다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = OmegaXis
	"이거 큰일인데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이 녀석들을 전부 해치우려면\n너무 오래 걸릴\n거야!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"그래…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"하지만 다른 방법이\n있어?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = None
	"거기까지다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 2 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"이 녀석들은 우리가\n상대할게."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너는 제어판으로\n가!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"으윽… 아악…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
script 3 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"너희는 안 돼!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이곳의 노이즈는 너희가\n감당하기엔 너무 강해!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"최대한 빨리 나가지 않으면\n너희는-"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"우린 걱정하지 마!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"우리가 폭주할 일은 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"폭주한 위저드처럼\n끔찍한 짓을 우리가\n저지를 리는 없어."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"그럴 때를 대비한\n자폭 프로그램이 있거든."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	"자폭…"
	wait30
	" 자폭이라고!?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"으윽!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"이곳의 노이즈가 정말\n믿을 수 없을 만큼 강해."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"벌써 시간이 다 됐어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MegaMan
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = SatellaPoliceWizard
	"록맨, 함께해서\n즐거웠어!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
